#
# writ_bend_monitor_substitute.run - Genode run script (build
# configuration), not Writ implementation. Genode channel lane, Task 2,
# run 2. The same route as run 1 (child writ_client_r, policy subject 1 =
# reader R), but the body claims subject S (claimed_subject 2) and names
# S's session (monitor session 2). The monitor ignores the claim and
# evaluates R: DataOS.commit_from_capability rejects because R is not the
# session's reader. Expected: Denied (decision 2) with reason 6, the
# library's own rejection (not reason 5, the descriptor refusal S would
# meet as a route subject). Exits nonzero when that changes.
# The shared procedure is scripts/genode/writ_bend_monitor/writ_bend_monitor.tcl.
#
source [select_from_repositories run/writ_bend_monitor.tcl]

writ_bend_monitor_run writ_client_r 2 0 2 2 6 0
